ome up with  uh to not lose this game so i think this  is a pretty fun opening  and trap that especially for black like  if you have  this down and you know every situation  inside it out it's gonna be very  difficult for your opponent to navigate  this correctly  and you can just obliterate some people  with this so hopefully you guys enjoyed  the budapest queen trap if you actually  uh deploy this and it works on your  opponent  let me know i'd love to see the game  send it to me  let me know in the chat as well i think  it is a good one so hopefully you  enjoyed this  video and i will see you guys next time

